Algorithm: Student Record Management System

Start.
Initialize the head pointer to NULL.
Display the menu: Insert, Display, Search, Delete, and Exit.
Enter the user's choice.
Perform the selected operation:
Insert: Enter the student's roll number and name, create a new node, and add it to the linked list.
Display: Traverse the linked list and display all student records.
Search: Enter the roll number and search for the student record.
Delete: Enter the roll number, find the record, and delete the corresponding node.
Exit: Terminate the program.
If the choice is not Exit, display the menu again.
Stop.
